{
 "name": "M21-1, Part XIII, Subpart ii, Chapter 2, Section C - State or Municipal Disability Preference Certificate",
 "content": "<p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;<a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000173824\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part XIII, Subpart ii, Chapter 2, Section B - Ratings for Veterans' Civil Service Disability Preference\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000173824?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">&lt;-- Previous Section</a>&nbsp; <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000173826\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part XIII, Subpart ii, Chapter 2, Section D - Information Sharing With the Office of Personnel Management (OPM)\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000173826?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">Next Section --&gt;</a></span></span></p><p><a id=\"top\" name=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong>Overview</strong></span></span></a></p><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">In This Section</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\">\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td id=\"cke_tmp_513\" style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">This section contains the topic \u201c<a href=\"#1\">State or Municipal Disability Preference Certificate</a>.\u201d</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span><br />&nbsp;</div><h2><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">1<a id=\"1\" name=\"1\">.</a>&nbsp; State or Municipal Disability Preference Certificate</span></span></h2><div>&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;</div><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Introduction</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td id=\"cke_tmp_508\" style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div>\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">This topic contains information on State or municipal disability preference certificates, including when</span></span></p>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><a href=\"#1a\">to issue a state or municipal disability preference certificate</a>, and</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><a href=\"#1b\">not to take adjudicative action</a>.&nbsp;</span></span></li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Change Date</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">February 3, 2011&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td id=\"cke_tmp_258\" style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">XIII.ii.2.C.1.a<a id=\"1a\" name=\"1a\">.</a>&nbsp; When to Issue a State or Municipal Disability Preference Certificate&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoBlockText\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">On request, furnish a disability preference certificate to the civil service authorities of a State or municipality if the following requirements are met</span></span></p>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li style=\"margin-left: 7.9pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">the requisite service-connected (SC) disability has been established based on a claim for benefits, and</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t<li style=\"margin-left: 7.9pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color: black\">prior ratings are in the claims folder or the determination is being made concurrently.&nbsp; </span></span></span></li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td id=\"cke_tmp_259\" style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">XIII.ii.2.C.1.b<a id=\"1b\" name=\"1b\">.</a>&nbsp; When Not to Take Adjudicative Action &nbsp;</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color: black\">Do <b><i>not</i></b> take adjudicative action solely for the purpose of issuing a disability preference certificate.&nbsp; If no rating decision of record exists, explain to the Veteran the requirements of a claim for SC benefits.</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><div></div><p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;<a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000173824\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part XIII, Subpart ii, Chapter 2, Section B - Ratings for Veterans' Civil Service Disability Preference\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000173824?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">&lt;-- Previous Section</a>&nbsp; <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000173826\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part XIII, Subpart ii, Chapter 2, Section D - Information Sharing With the Office of Personnel Management (OPM)\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000173826?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">Next Section --&gt;</a></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><a href=\"#top\">To Top</a></span></span></p>",
